Z||000007||SLYGUY||11-08-2001||04:02 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by banditbalz:<BR><B>Wow! If my vote wasn't horsepower biased, I think I kinda like this car better than the chopchop...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I agree. I'm a sucker for the 88GTs anyways.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>LT1...your 88 looks bran spankin' new. Love the color, and the deep deep wax!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly||||reg||1
Z||000008||LT1 Chop Top||11-08-2001||07:01 PM||||Triad,<P>My 88 has urethane bushings, drop spindles with AVO 12 position adjustable front shocks, aluminum/delrin front upper & lower control arm bushings.<BR>Wheels are DP Enduro 3 piece w/ 17x9 rear, and 16x7.5 front.<BR>Tires are Toyo Proxes 255-40-17 rear and 225-45-16 front.  I have no idea about the offset, as the rims came with the car.<BR>It also has cross drilled rotors (probably ocelot)...stops very fast, but not as fast as the 11.25" brakes on the Chop Top.<P>Glad you got a Fiero, but I miss you old sig pic!||||reg||1
Z||000009||TRiAD||11-08-2001||07:57 PM||||Thanks man!<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LT1 Chop Top:<BR><B>...Glad you got a Fiero, but I miss your old sig pic!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LOL! Yeah, if I had a fastback, I'd have probably kept it, but with it not being "my" car, and mine being a notchback, I didn't feel right using it anymore. <BR>Thanks for the compliment! <BR>Hopefully Ferrari_Momo will make that front fascia for me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>||||reg||1
